---
version: "0.1"
title: Z 世代消费趋势洞察
author: DPPT Pro
description: 商业级演示示例，展示 DPPT Pro 的 DSL 能力
theme:
  name: business
  colors:
    primary: "#0F172A"
    secondary: "#3B82F6"
    accent: "#F59E0B"
    background: "#F8FAFC"
    surface: "#FFFFFF"
    text: "#1E293B"
    muted: "#64748B"
  fonts:
    heading: "Microsoft YaHei"
    body: "Microsoft YaHei"
  text_styles:
    h1:
      font_family: "$heading"
      font_size: 54pt
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
    h2:
      font_family: "$heading"
      font_size: 36pt
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
    h3:
      font_family: "$heading"
      font_size: 24pt
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
    body:
      font_family: "$body"
      font_size: 18pt
      color: "$text"
    caption:
      font_family: "$body"
      font_size: 14pt
      color: "$muted"
  page_size: [13.333, 7.5]
pages:
  - type: cover
    layout: cover
    title: Z 世代消费趋势洞察
    subtitle: 2026 年度研究报告
    background:
      type: solid
      color: "$background"
    elements:
      - type: shape
        name: 顶部色块
        shape_type: rect
        bounds: {x: 0, y: 0, width: 13.333, height: 0.15}
        fill: {type: solid, color: "$secondary"}
      - type: shape
        name: 主视觉背景
        shape_type: rounded_rect
        rounded_radius: 0.2
        bounds: {x: 0.6, y: 1, width: 12.1, height: 5.5}
        fill: {type: solid, color: "$surface"}
        shadow: {color: "#000000", blur: 20, offset: [0, 4], alpha: 0.08}
      - type: text
        name: 标题
        text: Z 世代消费趋势洞察
        style: $h1
        bounds: {x: 1.2, y: 2.2, width: 10.9, height: 1.3}
      - type: text
        name: 副标题
        text: 2026 年度研究报告
        style: $h3
        bounds: {x: 1.2, y: 3.6, width: 10.9, height: 0.7}
      - type: text
        name: 报告信息
        text: DPPT Pro 出品 · 2026.07
        style: $caption
        bounds: {x: 1.2, y: 5.2, width: 10.9, height: 0.5}

  - type: toc
    layout: toc
    title: 目录
    background:
      type: solid
      color: "$background"
    elements:
      - type: text
        text: 目录
        style: $h2
        bounds: {x: 0.8, y: 0.6, width: 11.7, height: 0.9}
      - type: text
        text: |
          01  Z 世代画像
          02  消费偏好变迁
          03  渠道与触达
          04  数据洞察
          05  总结与建议
        style: $body
        bounds: {x: 1.5, y: 1.8, width: 10, height: 4}

  - type: content
    layout: two-column
    title: Z 世代画像
    elements:
      - type: text
        text: 01  Z 世代画像
        style: $h2
        bounds: {x: 0.8, y: 0.6, width: 11.7, height: 0.9}
      - type: text
        text: |
          Z 世代（1995-2010 年出生）是当前最具消费潜力的群体之一。

          核心特征：
          · 数字化原住民，社交媒体重度用户
          · 注重个性表达与情感价值
          · 对品牌authenticity要求高
          · 愿意为可持续产品支付溢价
        style: $body
        bounds: {x: 0.8, y: 1.8, width: 6, height: 4}
      - type: shape
        shape_type: rounded_rect
        bounds: {x: 7.2, y: 1.8, width: 5.2, height: 4}
        fill: {type: solid, color: "$surface"}
        border: {width: 1, color: "#E2E8F0"}
      - type: text
        text: |
          关键数据
          规模：2.8 亿人
          线上消费占比：47%
          月均可支配收入：¥4,850
        style: $body
        bounds: {x: 7.6, y: 2.2, width: 4.4, height: 3}

  - type: data
    layout: chart
    title: 年度消费支出分布
    elements:
      - type: text
        text: 02  消费偏好变迁
        style: $h2
        bounds: {x: 0.8, y: 0.6, width: 11.7, height: 0.9}
      - type: chart
        chart_type: bar
        labels: [餐饮, 服饰, 数码, 美妆, 文娱, 旅行]
        series:
          - name: 2024
            data: [2800, 1500, 2200, 1200, 900, 1800]
          - name: 2025
            data: [3100, 1350, 2600, 1100, 1200, 2400]
        colors: ["$secondary", "$accent"]
        bounds: {x: 0.8, y: 1.7, width: 7.5, height: 4.8}
      - type: text
        text: |
          洞察要点
          · 体验型消费（餐饮、旅行）持续增长
          · 数码产品支出增幅最大
          · 服饰美妆占比略有下降
        style: $body
        bounds: {x: 8.6, y: 1.7, width: 4, height: 4}

  - type: closing
    layout: closing
    title: 谢谢观看
    background:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
    elements:
      - type: text
        text: 谢谢观看
        style:
          font_family: "$heading"
          font_size: 60pt
          color: "#FFFFFF"
          bold: true
        bounds: {x: 0.8, y: 2.8, width: 11.7, height: 1.3}
      - type: text
        text: DPPT Pro · 让每一份演示都足够专业
        style:
          font_family: "$body"
          font_size: 20pt
          color: "#CBD5E1"
        bounds: {x: 0.8, y: 4.3, width: 11.7, height: 0.7}
